<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-S&amp;P rates General and Cologne Australia AAA.</title>
<headline>RTRS-S&amp;P rates General and Cologne Australia AAA.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp said it assigned its AAA claims-paying ability rating to General and Cologne Reinsurance Australia Ltd (GCRA).</p>
<p>S&amp;P said the rating reflects GCRA's close operational and strategic integration with its AAA-rated parent General Re Corporation and strong retrocession arrangements with General Re and AAA-rated Kolnische Ruckversicherungs-Gellschaft Ag, its local merger partner and majority owned subsidiary of General Re.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
